# AetherOS Package List - x86_64
# CRITICAL: NO inline comments after package names!
# archiso only supports # at the START of a line, not inline.
# Inline comments get parsed as part of the package name, causing
# "target not found" errors.
#
# AUR-only packages (eza, calamares, bauh, nwg-dock-hyprland,
# gtk-engine-murrine) are REMOVED from this list and will be
# installed post-install via Chaotic-AUR or first-boot.sh.

